    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0485" n="423" xml:id="pg423"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President’s Special Assistant</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the President’s
                        Secretary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Tully</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-15">September 15, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">MR-out</hi>-412. Personal and secret to Miss Grace
                    Tully from Harry Hopkins.</p>
                <p>I sent to the President memorandum entitled French Lend Lease Agreement and dated
                    September 11th from the State Department.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d247-f1"/> FEA
                    and State Department are anxious to know whether the President has initialed
                    it.</p>
                <p>Could you help me get an answer on this tomorrow?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry Hopkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
